#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""macro - record, edit and replay mouse/keyboard macros on Linux (Hyprland or X11).

Pure standard library. Talks to the kernel directly:
  * recording : reads /dev/input/event* (evdev)
  * playback  : creates virtual devices through /dev/uinput (no ydotool/ydotoold)
  * cursor    : Hyprland IPC socket (fast) or libX11 via ctypes
  * windows   : Hyprland IPC + hyprctl, or xdotool on X11

Commands: click record play edit convert trim merge compact stats windows keys
Run `macro COMMAND -h` for options.
"""
